Which solid folds up from this net?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (2,3);
\draw (2,0) rectangle (4,3);
\draw (4,0) rectangle (6,3);
\draw (0,3)--(1,{3+sqrt(3)})--(2,3);
\draw (0,0)--(1,{-sqrt(3)})--(2,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which solid folds up from this net?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.65]
\draw (1,0) rectangle (2,1);
\draw (1,1) rectangle (2,3);
\draw (1,3) rectangle (2,4);
\draw (1,4) rectangle (2,6);
\draw (0,1) rectangle (1,3);
\draw (2,1) rectangle (3,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Name the solid made by this net.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (2.5,2);
\draw (2.5,0) rectangle (5,2);
\draw (5,0) rectangle (7.5,2);
\draw (7.5,0) rectangle (10,2);
\draw (0,2)--(2.5,2)--(4,4)--(1.5,4)--cycle;
\draw (0,0)--(2.5,0)--(4,-2)--(1.5,-2)--cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
